# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Never commit .env file with real values
# Add actual values in production (Vercel environment variables)

# Supabase Configuration (PUBLIC - safe to expose in client)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# ⚠️ SECURITY NOTES:
# 1. The ANON key is SAFE to expose - it's meant for client use
# 2. Supabase RLS policies control what the anon key can access
# 3. NEVER add service_role keys here - those are SERVER ONLY
# 4. Review your Supabase RLS policies regularly